<view class="page"><view class="title">把想买的，都记下来。</view><view class="subtitle">清单按预计购买量计算，已购商品不计入待购总价。</view><view wx:if="{{!hasItems}}" class="empty"><image class="empty-icon" src="/assets/bag-active.png"/><view>清单还是空的，去挑点喜欢的。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="browse">去逛逛</button></view><block wx:if="{{hasItems}}"><view class="row section-title"><text>我的清单 · {{count}} 种</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="clearPurchased" disabled="{{busy}}">清除已购</button></view><view class="cart-items"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="productId" class="cart-item {{item.checked ? 'checked' : ''}}"><view class="row"><checkbox-group bindchange="check" data-id="{{item.productId}}"><checkbox value="{{item.productId}}" checked="{{item.checked}}" color="#315443" disabled="{{busy}}"/></checkbox-group><image class="thumb" src="{{item.product.imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="grow"><view class="item-name">{{item.product.name}}</view><view class="note">{{item.product.categoryName}} · {{item.product.shelf}}</view><view class="note">{{item.amount}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.previous}}" class="note">此前已购：{{item.previous}}</view></view><button class="text-button" bindtap="remove" data-id="{{item.productId}}" disabled="{{busy}}">移除</button></view><view class="row quantity-row"><button class="text-button" bindtap="go" data-id="{{item.productId}}">带我去</button><view class="quantity"><button data-id="{{item.productId}}" data-delta="-1" bindtap="changeQuantity" disabled="{{busy || !item.canMinus}}">减</button><text>{{item.amount}}</text><button data-id="{{item.productId}}" data-delta="1" bindtap="changeQuantity" disabled="{{busy || !item.canPlus}}">加</button></view><text class="item-total">¥{{item.total}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!item.product.stock}}" class="error">此商品已售罄，请移除或换购。</view></view></view><view class="panel summary"><view class="panel-body"><view class="row"><text>待购合计</text><text class="price">¥{{total}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{budget}}" class="budget {{over ? 'over' : ''}}">预算 ¥{{budget}} · {{over ? '超出' : '还余'}} ¥{{remaining}}</view><view class="note">称重商品以实际结算为准；加减按钮按预计重量调整。</view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="route" disabled="{{busy || !canRoute}}">规划采购路线</button></view><view class="row"><button class="text-button" bindtap="undo" disabled="{{busy || !canUndo}}">撤销上一次操作</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="browse">继续挑选</button></view></view></view></block></view>
